"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Warren County&rsquo;s record from 1951 to 2025 shows September to October under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. In 2025 the middle came in at 47% of normal for October to November and 50% for November to December in 2025. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 39% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
